          "es": "Ese gigante subió a un bote con su esposa, y así se salvaron.",
          "en": "That giant climbed into a boat with his wife, and they were saved."
        },
        {
          "es": "Todos los gigantes de hielo que vinieron después nacieron de esos dos.",
          "en": "All the frost giants who came later were born from those two."
